          "severity": "warn",
          "latest_message": "We continue to make substantial progress toward resolving the issue affecting estimated cost and usage data displayed in the Billing and Cost Management Console. Our mitigation efforts are working as expected and we are seeing an increasing number of accounts reflecting correct cost and usage data. We expect all affected accounts to be fully recovered by July 19, 12:00 AM PDT. Until the backfill is complete, some customers may still observe incorrect cost and usage data in the Billing and Cost Management Console and Cost and Usage Reports. These estimates do not reflect actual usage or charges. We will provide another update by July 18, 7:00 AM PDT, or sooner if additional information becomes available."
